flowchart LR
  Admin[Intune admin] --> Package[Intune remediation package]
  Package --> Detect[Detection script]
  Detect -->|exit 0| Done[No remediation]
  Detect -->|exit 1| Remediate[Remediation script]
  Remediate --> Services[Start/correct services]
  Remediate --> Queue[Clean stale BITS queue]
  Remediate --> Cache[Ensure cache folder]
  Remediate --> Logs[Local MK logs]
  Package --> Reports[Intune reporting]
  Reports --> Admin
